1
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,720
<i>Lee Yun?</i>

2
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:09,800
Lee Yun!

3
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:11,680
Lee Yun!

4
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:17,920
Lee Yun.

5
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:19,520
Lee Yun.

6
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,400
Lee Yun.

7
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,439
Mom!

8
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,440
Get in, quick!

9
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,640
Lee Yun!

10
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,600
I'm sorry…

11
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:01,440
I don't know what happened to the mirror.

12
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:04,440
Mei-ling…

13
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,720
Mei-ling is leaving

14
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,880
with another man.

15
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:13,800
And An-an.

16
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,479
What?

17
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,760
That's Dr. Sun's car.

18
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,640
They're leaving with him.

19
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,520
<i>I thought you were honest.</i>

20
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,480
To be honest,

21
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:55,760
you don't decide whether you can go back.

22
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,320
Wei-zhe does.

23
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,040
<i>When he gets to your house,</i>

24
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,840
<i>he'll take down the basement mirror.</i>

25
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:08,560
<i>When it's time to return,
he'll put it back.</i>

26
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:14,440
<i>He says that if one mirror is taken down,
none of them will crack.</i>

27
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:30,439
Dad, it keeps thundering.

28
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,840
How much longer?

29
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,359
A little farther.

30
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,960
To the pavilion.

31
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:52,640
<i>Lightning.</i>

32
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:56,679
I saw it,

33
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:59,439
then turned around and Yoo-shin was gone.

34
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,439
Lightning.

35
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:03,800
Half an hour ago, you said thunder.

36
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:06,400
Now you're saying lightning.

37
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:09,679
Which was it? Can you clarify?

38
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,680
I don't know.

39
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:15,999
I saw lightning, then Yoo-shin was gone.

40
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,880
He disappeared right before my eyes,
right before my eyes.

41
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:22,520
I want to know why too.

42
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,720
One last time.

43
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:28,240
Did you leave Yoo-shin there on purpose?

44
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:41,760
Dad, the fog's gone. Should we keep going?

45
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,280
Dad,

46
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,640
when Mom's off,
can we all come back together?

47
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:53,319
On a nice day,
there should be lots of birds, insects,

48
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:54,560
and the Emperor moth.

49
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,440
My teacher said Emperor moth are gone.

50
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,240
Dad, didn't you know?

51
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:04,399
I hate the Emperor moth.

52
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,640
They're scary.

53
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,640
Are there a lot over there?

54
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,039
Where?

55
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,920
The world where He Yoo-shin is.

56
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,560
Let's go home. Come on.

57
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,799
I don't want to be He Yoo-shin.

58
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,000
I'm your child, Xu Li-an.

59
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,639
Stop scratching.

60
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:00,759
You'll get hurt.

61
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:02,680
- Turn around.
- But it itches.

62
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:05,480
Here.

63
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,119
Is this better?

64
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,559
Feels good.

65
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,959
Okay. Apply medicine.

66
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,560
Just scratch it a little more.

67
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:21,519
If you want to go back, go alone.

68
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,280
Why take An-an?

69
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,839
You're just like your wife.

70
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:29,479
Are you trying to take him away?

71
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:32,200
Or leave him in the mountains
to get revenge?

72
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:35,120
I'd never leave him alone
in the mountains.

73
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,360
I couldn't.

74
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,120
Why is the mirror on floor?

75
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,480
He'd better not come back

76
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,640
and take anyone while I'm gone.

77
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,520
What do you mean?

78
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,000
Why did you lie to me?

79
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,400
Why?

80
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,040
Don't be angry.

81
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:28,280
Wei-zhe knows how much you've done.

82
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,760
He didn't want you to worry,

83
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:36,120
so he handled everything himself.

84
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,959
That's why he kept it from you.

85
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,400
The mirror cracked,

86
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:45,640
the passage stayed shut.
He must have done it.

87
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:49,839
He never wanted An-an and me to go there.

88
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,440
Don't think that way.

89
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:56,560
Something must have happened,
so he couldn't let you go back.

90
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,440
Honestly,

91
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,760
Wei-zhe really needs you.

92
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,680
You're all he has.

93
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,480
I thought

94
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,880
I could rely on him.

95
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,680
But where was he when I needed him?

96
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:29,280
Eat up.

97
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:31,560
I'll bathe you after.

98
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,200
Mei-ling,

99
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,679
I'm begging you.

100
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,919
Don't blame him.

101
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:42,679
Please.

102
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,320
Mei-ling,

103
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:50,040
please,

104
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:52,920
don't blame him.

105
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:16,879
Where's Jian-cheng?

106
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,239
Where's he?

107
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,840
Can't hear you.

108
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:23,040
The basement.
Go downstairs and you'll know.

109
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:42,240
HANG THE MIRROR
BACK IN THE BASEMENT

110
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:21,240
I HAVE SOMETHING TO SHOW YOU
AND I ALSO HAVE AN-AN'S SUPPLEMENTS.

111
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:50,880
PSYCHIATRY CLINIC

112
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:04,840
Take a look.

113
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:08,040
If it's okay, sign it.

114
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:17,440
Is she getting divorced too?

115
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,879
It has nothing to do with her.

116
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:24,439
I can support you monthly
but not indefinitely.

117
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,959
Or I can give you a lump sum.

118
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:28,719
If you want a job, I know people in Taipei
who can help--

119
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,999
What about the kids?

120
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,079
It's all there. Read it yourself.

121
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,759
We're closed tonight.

122
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:35,320
Put up the sign when you leave.

123
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,280
Going to Dr. Sun?

124
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:57,120
Don't.

125
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:08,040
His wife contacted me.

126
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:11,719
You plan to leave Xu Wei-zhe,

127
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,120
not go to our world.

128
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:16,840
Will your choice

129
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:21,160
affect what he does next?

130
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:25,000
Is that all you care about?

131
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:27,920
What else?

132
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:31,239
Then there's no need to explain.

133
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:32,600
Mei-ling.

134
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,359
The way he treated his wife,

135
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:39,080
he'll treat you the same way.

136
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,920
Understand?

137
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:56,240
<i>- Hello?</i>
- Hello, Dad?

138
00:14:56,840 --> 00:15:00,719
You haven't read my messages or replied.
Mom won't answer either.

139
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:02,479
<i>I just took her out.</i>

140
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,240
<i>I'm driving. What's wrong?</i>

141
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:07,240
I want to come home this week.

142
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:10,760
Don't you have school?

143
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:13,360
<i>But I wanna come home.</i>

144
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,120
Sure.

145
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:20,200
Come home if you want.

146
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:22,840
- I'll pick you up on Friday.
<i>- Really?</i>

147
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:26,760
<i>Where's Mom? Put her on.</i>

148
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,600
<i>She's cooking.</i>

149
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:31,120
<i>I'll tell her.</i>

150
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,439
But she only replies by text.

151
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:36,320
It's been so long since I talked to her.

152
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:38,720
Is she okay?

153
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,600
<i>She's fine.</i>

154
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,560
<i>I gotta go.</i>

155
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,960
I have to go help her. Bye.

156
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,879
Why do you want Yu-jhen back?

157
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:52,799
Why not let her come back?

158
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:54,679
She has to face it eventually.

159
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:56,920
I'll be a good dad. Don't worry.

160
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,080
Where to?

161
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:07,040
I'll go make dinner.

162
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:32,359
<i>Eastern air quality is expected
to reach hazardous AQI levels,</i>

163
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:35,079
<i>50 times above the safe limit.</i>

164
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:37,919
<i>Four children with epilepsy</i>

165
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:41,399
<i>have reportedly died in recent days.</i>

166
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:43,999
<i>Parents are urged
to keep their children safe.</i>

167
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,160
<i>The government advises children to…</i>

168
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:51,159
<i>Mom, Dad was great today.</i>

169
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:54,520
<i>He taught me some hard math
and I learned it right away.</i>

170
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,560
<i>Are you coming home?</i>

171
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:36,600
Brother!

172
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:38,599
Da-jun.

173
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:41,319
You offered, so I came for a drink,

174
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:43,639
and to check on sister-in-law.

175
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:45,000
Today isn't a good time.

176
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:47,559
Da-jun!

177
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:48,679
Sister-in-law.

178
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:50,119
Are you cooking?

179
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,719
It smells so good!

180
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,840
Come in.

181
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:54,720
Have dinner with us.

182
00:17:58,360 --> 00:18:01,639
Brother, I also brought your favorite,

183
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,840
kaoliang liquor.

184
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:05,719
You didn't have to.

185
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:06,840
Come on in.

186
00:18:12,320 --> 00:18:13,640
You believe me, right?

187
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:17,560
Don't drink the soup, remember.

188
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:31,719
Don't turn it on. It's a waste of power.

189
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,880
Mei-ling said to.

190
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:35,040
It's humid today.

191
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:54,440
I know you've had a hard life.

192
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:58,880
When my mom was sick,

193
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:02,080
I knew how much she suffered.

194
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:05,640
I didn't want to lose her.

195
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:09,520
I wanted her to live for me,

196
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,840
but she had no choice.

197
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:20,560
You do.

198
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:26,560
Can you let go of those thoughts?

199
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:51,640
Remember the Black King Kong at my place?

200
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:54,560
I said someone gave it to me,

201
00:19:55,560 --> 00:19:57,359
and I'm taking it to Dad in Taipei.

202
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:59,400
He loves it. Remember?

203
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:05,519
Of course. How could I forget?

204
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:08,680
Come on, don't be shy.

205
00:20:13,560 --> 00:20:15,039
The chicken soup is great.

206
00:20:15,040 --> 00:20:16,320
You have to try it.

207
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:19,400
Get Da-jun a bowl.

208
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:23,440
No, it's okay.

209
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:25,959
I'm already full.

210
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:28,080
You said it smelled good. Have some.

211
00:20:28,760 --> 00:20:29,840
Get Da-jun a bowl.

212
00:20:30,760 --> 00:20:31,760
Okay.

213
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:38,559
- Have a drink.
- I can do it myself.

214
00:20:38,560 --> 00:20:39,400
Here.

215
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:48,040
No need. Just a little.

216
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:49,760
I'm really full.

217
00:20:55,520 --> 00:20:56,600
It's hot.

218
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:01,720
Try it.

219
00:21:03,040 --> 00:21:05,120
Don't force him if he doesn't want it.

220
00:21:12,840 --> 00:21:15,800
Hey, have you read the contract?

221
00:21:18,480 --> 00:21:20,560
I knew you had a reason for coming.

222
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:29,560
We're moving out.

223
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:32,720
I'll get the contract.

224
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,799
Give me the soup.

225
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:42,480
Sister-in-law, I really don't know
how to help you.

226
00:21:44,120 --> 00:21:45,599
Help me tie him up.

227
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:47,160
"Tie him up"? How?

228
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:55,880
First,

229
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:58,520
the price is firm.

230
00:21:59,560 --> 00:22:01,400
There's no room to negotiate.

231
00:22:03,840 --> 00:22:05,800
Let's do it next month.

232
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:14,960
We have things to take care of…

233
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:23,400
and want privacy.

234
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:26,800
Leave it to me. Don't worry.

235
00:22:27,800 --> 00:22:29,840
Come on, eat. Don't be shy.

236
00:22:38,560 --> 00:22:40,640
Have another drink.

237
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:00,720
You're going to take
our divorce papers to her.

238
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:09,560
You want custody?

239
00:23:11,080 --> 00:23:12,199
Do you think you can

240
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:14,199
take care of them like this?

241
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,520
- I can.
- You can?

242
00:23:20,760 --> 00:23:23,559
How much time do you spend with them?

243
00:23:23,560 --> 00:23:27,799
You don't know how to raise kids
even with my parents' help.

244
00:23:27,800 --> 00:23:31,200
What makes you think you deserve custody?

245
00:23:31,800 --> 00:23:34,440
I'll let you see them anytime.

246
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:36,840
Isn't that enough?

247
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:40,560
I'm telling you,

248
00:23:41,560 --> 00:23:43,559
the kids are staying with me.

249
00:23:43,560 --> 00:23:46,480
Take me to court,
the judge will rule in my favor.

250
00:23:47,080 --> 00:23:48,200
Want to try?

251
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:51,080
Sign it again.

252
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,480
Hello?

253
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:04,080
<i>Mr. Hsu,</i>

254
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,920
<i>this is Ms. Kao.</i>

255
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:08,559
I need a witness.

256
00:24:08,560 --> 00:24:10,799
Who are you calling? I have a witness.

257
00:24:10,800 --> 00:24:12,320
Can you help me?

258
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:16,399
Can you meet me at our usual cafe?
I need your help.

259
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:19,279
- Give it to me.
- Mr. Hsu.

260
00:24:19,280 --> 00:24:20,960
- Give me the phone!
- Mr. Hsu.

261
00:24:27,760 --> 00:24:28,760
<i>Hello?</i>

262
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:31,920
<i>Hello?</i>

263
00:24:33,760 --> 00:24:34,760
Hello?

264
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:39,280
You hit me?

265
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:44,320
You hit me for that woman?

266
00:24:50,040 --> 00:24:52,560
I don't know what's happened to me.

267
00:24:56,080 --> 00:24:58,200
Maybe I'm just sick of you.

268
00:25:01,720 --> 00:25:02,920
Just sign it.

269
00:25:34,320 --> 00:25:36,040
CALLING SUN RONG-GUANG.

270
00:25:46,560 --> 00:25:47,560
Mei-ling!

271
00:25:48,760 --> 00:25:49,999
Why are you here?

272
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:51,560
I'm here to take you home.

273
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:53,599
I don't need your help.

274
00:25:53,600 --> 00:25:54,640
Mei-ling?

275
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:56,799
Mei-ling?

276
